Notes for Lab Submission
Always start MongoDB service (mongod) before running these commands.
Use .pretty() for readable output.
ObjectIds will be different every time you run the commands.
After question 20, you can recreate the database if needed for further experiments (as mentioned in question 21 of the sheet).